   "pressure_range_status": "reference_parameterization",
   "notes": "Anderson et al. Equation (29): the adopted 300 K BM3 curve KT0=166.65 GPa and K0'=5.4823 is combined with [0.00714-0.0115*ln(V0/V)]*(T-300) GPa. V0=67.79 A^3 is converted from the paper's ambient density 19.30 g/cm^3 and atomic mass 196.967 g/mol for the four-atom fcc cell. Table V covers V/V0=0.66-1 and 300-3000 K. The stored 0.001 GPa/K dK_dT_V error is the explicit propagated contribution reported for the near-identical K0'=5.5 calculation; the paper notes an additional unquantified contribution from K0' uncertainty. No complete covariance matrix or errors for the adopted static parameters are published.",
